Ah, so from here we go to check out the stage, right?

213
00:31:07,160 --> 00:31:10,200
ほんとすっよ！まじ存在感やっべ〜！
Seriously awesome! Their presence is insane~!

214
00:31:10,410 --> 00:31:11,150
え、すごーい！
Eh, amazing!

215
00:31:11,800 --> 00:31:13,160
ってか、この広場も開放的でおしゃれ〜
I mean, this plaza is also open and stylish~

216
00:31:16,530 --> 00:31:19,040
こりゃ、ずっといたくなっちゃうわ。
Man, I'll end up wanting to stay here forever.

217
