Decided! Let's go with our very first song!

270
00:34:51,180 --> 00:34:53,690
ライブするメンバーを決めよう。
Let's decide on the members for the live show.

271
00:34:56,290 --> 00:34:57,240
話しかける。
Talk to them.

272
00:35:00,102 --> 00:35:00,622
おっ。
Oh.

273
00:35:03,582 --> 00:35:05,162
あ、ごめん。わしが、
Ah, sorry. I...

