Um... rhythm game, dopapappa "aruaru" (relatable trope), can I? Gacha game, dopapappa gacha "aruaru" goes. Eh, instead of saving 10 tickets for a 10-pull, pulling the moment 1 ticket accumulates. How many gems does HoloDori need? 250, right?

