1093
02:07:40,269 --> 02:07:42,189
見れないよ、もし。見えない。
You can't see it, if you look closely. You can't see it.

1094
02:07:45,569 --> 02:07:46,749
染めるスキルはない。ふーん。
There's no skill to dye attributes. Hmm.

1095
02:07:47,229 --> 02:07:48,169
あ、左下。
Ah, bottom left.

1096
02:07:49,069 --> 02:07:50,269
左下。
Bottom left.

1097
02:07:50,609 --> 02:07:51,889
左下。
Bottom left.

1098
02:07:53,589 --> 02:07:54,889
左下。
Bottom left.

1099
