Um, next week is full of offline collabs, full of offline collabs!

1163
02:16:01,815 --> 02:16:06,405
あの、注目配信は18日水曜日の夜、
Um, the highlight stream is Wednesday night, the 18th.

1164
02:16:06,615 --> 02:16:11,615
お仕事が終わったら、きょうことわしのお家で飲酒おふコラボをするのじゃ。
After work, Kyoko and I are doing a drinking offline collab at my place.

1165
